{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F4JXvLhgzGpAjb4V26afxu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-1430-warp-tiled-gkr-intermediates\n2\t\n3\tReorganize the GKR input evaluation GLOBAL-mode intermediates buffer from a thread-interleaved layout (stride = 65536) to a warp-tiled layout (stride = 32) to improve GPU cache locality. The `evaluate_interactions_gkr_kernel<true>` is the single largest GPU kernel at 464ms (19.5% of total GPU time), and its intermediates buffer accesses currently cause systematic TLB misses and defeat hardware prefetching because consecutive DAG node accesses within a thread jump 65536 × 16 = 1MB apart. With warp-tiled layout, per-warp working set drops from ~100MB scattered to ~50KB contiguous, enabling hardware prefetch (stride 512B vs 1MB), reducing TLB pressure by ~8x, and improving L2 sector reuse, for an estimated 1.2-1.5x kernel speedup translating to 30-60ms wall-time reduction on LogUp GKR.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8f518d6-4de0-4c05-9b5a-ade72ff81f39","uuid":"ac4e78fc-730b-4860-a618-051d7a0826e1","timestamp":"2026-04-14T11:26:29.492Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-14-1430-warp-tiled-gkr-intermediates\n\nReorganize the GKR input evaluation GLOBAL-mode intermediates buffer from a thread-interleaved layout (stride = 65536) to a warp-tiled layout (stride = 32) to improve GPU cache locality. The `evaluate_interactions_gkr_kernel<true>` is the single largest GPU kernel at 464ms (19.5% of total GPU time), and its intermediates buffer accesses currently cause systematic TLB misses and defeat hardware prefetching because consecutive DAG node accesses within a thread jump 65536 × 16 = 1MB apart. With warp-tiled layout, per-warp working set drops from ~100MB scattered to ~50KB contiguous, enabling hardware prefetch (stride 512B vs 1MB), reducing TLB pressure by ~8x, and improving L2 sector reuse, for an estimated 1.2-1.5x kernel speedup translating to 30-60ms wall-time reduction on LogUp GKR.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
