            \"start index has to be smaller than length\"\n97\t        );\n98\t        let size_bytes = std::mem::size_of::<T>() * (self.len - start_idx);\n99\t        check(unsafe {\n100\t            cudaMemsetAsync("}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FRM88RjihKG73ZqoC41xCi","session_id":"c8f518d6-4de0-4c05-9b5a-ade72ff81f39","uuid":"38836097-053a-46f1-a619-8b57aae02679","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:04:11.227Z"}
