{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0132h5c1qz869VpdGpqke5P9","type":"tool_result","content":"=== task.md ===\n# 2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers\n\nReplace per-round DeviceMatrix allocations in the constraints-phase MLE fold (`fold_mle_evals`) with pre-allocated contiguous ping-pong buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~1400 new DeviceMatrix objects (one per foldable trace matrix across mat_evals and sels) and frees the previous round's ~1400 matrices, totaling ~37K cudaMallocAsync + ~37K cudaFreeAsync calls across 24 MLE rounds at APC 300. By pre-allocating two contiguous buffers (one for even rounds, one for odd) and computing per-trace offsets by halving the previous round's layout, we eliminate all per-round allocation/deallocation overhead (~15-20ms) while preserving the existing batched fold kernel.\n\n=== plan.md ===\n# Plan: Ping-Pong MLE Fold Buffers\n\n## Goal\n\n=== baseline exists ===\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/baseline/apc300.json\nYES\n\n=== current measurement exists ===\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc300.json\nYES\n\n=== no source code changes ===\n[rerun: b29]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8f518d6-4de0-4c05-9b5a-ade72ff81f39","uuid":"60e0684b-462c-4c8d-a73f-186692b367da","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:09:01.485Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== task.md ===\n# 2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers\n\nReplace per-round DeviceMatrix allocations in the constraints-phase MLE fold (`fold_mle_evals`) with pre-allocated contiguous ping-pong buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~1400 new DeviceMatrix objects (one per foldable trace matrix across mat_evals and sels) and frees the previous round's ~1400 matrices, totaling ~37K cudaMallocAsync + ~37K cudaFreeAsync calls across 24 MLE rounds at APC 300. By pre-allocating two contiguous buffers (one for even rounds, one for odd) and computing per-trace offsets by halving the previous round's layout, we eliminate all per-round allocation/deallocation overhead (~15-20ms) while preserving the existing batched fold kernel.\n\n=== plan.md ===\n# Plan: Ping-Pong MLE Fold Buffers\n\n## Goal\n\n=== baseline exists ===\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/baseline/apc300.json\nYES\n\n=== current measurement exists ===\n/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc300.json\nYES\n\n=== no source code changes ===","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
